WEBVTT

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.500
"RYUSEITAI Hero Show"

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:30.000
"RYUSEITAI Stage Event Proposal"

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:40.330
<i>We'll make it shine...</i>

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:44.540
<i>This "miracle"</i>

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:58.250
<i>It's what I think we'll call these days</i>

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:02.870
<i>We've run desperately</i>

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:07.040
<i>If it's somewhere that anyone can get to</i>

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:12.250
<i>They wouldn't call us being here</i> a miracle, right?

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.540
<i>Revolution days.</i>

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:15.330
<i>If you come to a stop</i>

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:16.200
<i>Break the limits.</i>

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.700
<i>You won't be able to go beyond</i>

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:18.790
<i>We can make new ways.</i>

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:20.120
<i>Now, let's start</i>

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:21.500
<i>Just face to face.</i>

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.790
<i>Toward that... unending sky</i>

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:30.500
<i>Right now, what we're making resound</i>

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:36.370
<i>(All through the days.)</i> Is an ensemble where we make each other better

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:41.080
<i>If we don't improve ourselves,</i> then we can't shine

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:50.830
<i>(We're beyond the sky.)</i> It's what we'll call the stars... a "miracle"

