00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:27.000
"Tenka Muteki☆Meteo Renjaa!"

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:22.830
<i>Call us anytime with a voice that</i> reaches to the other side of a dream

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:30.540
<i>Let's rush over, RYUSEITAI! Meteor scramble</i>

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:38.370
<i>If you keep on giving up</i>

00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:40.120
<i>(NO MORE)</i>

00:22:40.120 --> 00:22:44.790
<i>You can't go the distances you want to go</i>

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:49.700
<i>We'll give you the courage</i>

00:22:49.700 --> 00:22:55.580
<i>(GO FORWARD)</i> To face your troubles head-on

00:22:57.330 --> 00:23:00.250
<i>Come, LET ME DREAM</i>

00:23:00.250 --> 00:23:02.700
<i>We'll become</i>

00:23:02.700 --> 00:23:05.160
<i>As passionate as</i>

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:08.620
<i>The gazes you've given us</i>

00:23:10.330 --> 00:23:15.910
<i>I'm sure the sun will rise to protect our dreams</i>

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:21.620
<i>We'll even turn sparkles into power and evolve</i>

00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:27.790
<i>Pass the clouds and fly to the heights</i> where thousands of voices are

00:23:27.790 --> 00:23:34.830
<i>Rain down, RYUSEITAI! Meteor scramble</i>

00:23:34.830 --> 00:23:38.040
<i>Today, too, HERE WE GO!!!!!</i>

